---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Methodology — How Facilities Get Listed" description="How a washroom gets listed, what counts as verified, and what we refuse to publish.">
  <section class="wrap hero"><h1 class="h1">Methodology</h1></section>
  <section class="wrap section">
    <p class="lede">A facility is listed only when it can be sourced.</p>
    <h2 class="h2">Sources</h2>
    <ul><li>OpenStreetMap, filtered to washroom and facility records.</li><li>Reader submissions, reviewed before publishing.</li></ul>
    <h2 class="h2">What we will not publish</h2>
    <ul><li>A coordinate we have not verified.</li><li>An amenity inferred from the venue's brand.</li><li>An access rule we have not confirmed — it shows as “not recorded”.</li></ul>
    <p>Each card shows its source and the date it was last verified.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .hero { padding: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 3rem) 0 .5rem; }
  .section { padding: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem; max-width: 46rem; }
  .section p, .section li { line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-ink-soft); }
  .section h2 { margin-top: 1.8rem; }
</style>
